# This repo has no Prettier of its own, but an ancestor `.prettierrc` in the
# master umbrella reaches it: `proseWrap: "never"` unwraps README.md and
# CHANGELOG.md onto single 2000-column lines, so a one-line change arrives as a
# whole-file diff. Both are hand-wrapped and read far more often than edited.
#
# The frontend the template STAMPS is a different matter — it carries its own
# prettier, config and hook under template/frontend/, and formats normally.
*.md
